Joget-Description: An enterprise-grade Microsoft Outlook Calendar integr
 ation suite for Joget.This suite provides complete Microsoft Graph inte
 gration including event creation, update, cancellation, synchronization
 , listing, calendar views, Teams meeting support, recurrence handling, 
 and tenant-wide background sync.Additional features include push notifi
 cation reminders before events, Microsoft Graph login integration for s
 ecure authentication, automatic token storage in Joget database, and a 
 scheduler service to refresh expired access tokens to maintain uninterr
 upted connectivity.
Joget-Name: Microsoft Calendar and Events Integration Suite
